1
00:01:05,247 --> 00:01:08,528
[Episode 2]

2
00:01:08,528 --> 00:01:10,140
Just a signature...

3
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,760
You dared to slap me?

4
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,739
Yes, I did!

5
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,640
I seem rough

6
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,799
because I butcher
and sell meat for my father.

7
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:37,280
That street's mixed.

8
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,325
If I weren't tough,

9
00:01:38,325 --> 00:01:40,239
I'd have been pushed around by thugs.

10
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:42,420
How could you look down on me?

11
00:01:46,373 --> 00:01:49,173
You mock my gaudy clothes
and act so high and mighty,

12
00:01:49,173 --> 00:01:50,959
but everything I wear

13
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:53,219
was earned with my own hands!

14
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:58,079
You can't carry anything or lift a finger.

15
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,719
You were born rich and spoiled.

16
00:01:59,719 --> 00:02:02,006
How could you look down on me?

17
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:04,680
You mock my illiteracy.

18
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,560
It's because I had to run the house.

19
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,280
I had neither the time
nor the money to study!

20
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,400
It's not that I didn't want to.

21
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,419
I couldn't, and I resent it.

22
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:16,740
How could you look down on me?

23
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:25,680
Did I choose to be crude, vulgar,

24
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,699
or illiterate
just so you could look down on me?

25
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:36,520
I've long heard you're a scholar of Yangzhou,

26
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,838
well-versed in all state affairs.

27
00:02:38,838 --> 00:02:41,339
But you only see the sky
and ignore the earth.

28
00:02:41,339 --> 00:02:44,699
Do you even deserve to be called a scholar,
or even a man?

29
00:02:56,611 --> 00:02:58,481
I've said my piece.

30
00:02:58,481 --> 00:03:01,057
Divorce me if you want. It's fine.

31
00:03:01,057 --> 00:03:02,938
I can take back my betrothal gifts

32
00:03:02,938 --> 00:03:05,000
before anyone else benefits.

33
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,759
I thought I'd made a good match,

34
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:10,680
but I must've been blinded,

35
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:14,139
blessed with the worst luck ever
to marry a worthless man.

36
00:03:37,918 --> 00:03:39,842
What about you?

37
00:03:39,842 --> 00:03:42,460
How much do you know about my situation?

38
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:47,840
Why are my legs crippled?
Why am I not going home?

39
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,740
Why did I marry you?

40
00:03:51,128 --> 00:03:54,639
In a prominent family
full of schemes and prowling wolves,

41
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:57,560
you think it was bad luck, youthful folly,
or coincidence.

42
00:03:57,560 --> 00:04:00,539
In fact, it was a bloody path
plotted and paved by others.

43
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,740
How could you hit me?

44
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:14,000
Fine.

45
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,860
Why not stay here?

46
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,699
You can leave
after they strip you to the bone.

47
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:43,639
You... You scoundrel!

48
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:46,339
- Keep going!
- Fine, I will!

49
00:04:48,734 --> 00:04:50,234
Smash it!

50
00:05:00,233 --> 00:05:03,560
50 taels. 127 taels.

51
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:09,459
263 taels. 1,558 taels. In total...

52
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:13,139
1,998 taels.

53
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:21,240
Butchering pigs daily nets me 120 wen.

54
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:24,800
That's 3 taels and 6 mace a month,
and 43 taels and 8 mace a year.

55
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:27,079
To pay back this 1,998 taels,

56
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:29,600
it'd take 16,650 days
without eating or drinking.

57
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:32,120
That's 45 years?

58
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:34,600
You smashed precious antiques
in my residence,

59
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:38,279
causing a loss of 1,998 taels.

60
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,920
Since you have no money to pay,

61
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:44,959
you'll stay in the Xie family
to attend to me at my command.

62
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:47,519
Laundry, sweeping, serving tea,
and fetching water.

63
00:05:47,519 --> 00:05:49,839
All heavy chores will be done by you.

64
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:52,040
You will obey every order in the manor,

65
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:55,627
working like a beast of burden
to repay your debt.

66
00:05:55,627 --> 00:05:57,259
Serve three years.

67
00:05:58,079 --> 00:06:00,489
Debt paid, and you are free.

68
00:06:00,489 --> 00:06:01,989
Will you sign,

69
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,420
or not?

70
00:06:14,352 --> 00:06:15,720
[Labor Debt Agreement]

71
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,354
Fine, I'll sign.

72
00:06:17,354 --> 00:06:19,279
What's there to be smug about?

73
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:22,980
666 taels a year. Who knows
who's really getting the raw deal?

74
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,439
This better be important.

75
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:44,394
Why do you get a bed and I'm on the floor?

76
00:06:44,394 --> 00:06:47,311
- A husband is the guide to his wife.
- What's that supposed to mean?

77
00:06:47,311 --> 00:06:50,040
A woman must obey her husband.

78
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,415
Who said that?

79
00:06:51,415 --> 00:06:52,805
Dong Zhong Shu.

80
00:06:52,805 --> 00:06:54,420
What did Aunt Dong say?

81
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:56,920
Not the "Shu" as in "uncle."

82
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,279
Then which "Shu" is it?

83
00:06:58,279 --> 00:07:00,379
The "Shu" as in "comfort."

84
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,920
Laozi said a wife
is the guide to her husband!

85
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,360
When did Laozi say that?

86
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:09,720
Not that Laozi.
It's me, standing right in front of you!

87
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:10,720
Hand it over.

88
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,160
- Why?
- Hand it over.

89
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,639
No!

90
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,639
Give it to me.

91
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,839
No!

92
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:17,339
Give it to me!

93
00:07:25,113 --> 00:07:26,939
You...

94
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,699
Jin Bao Zhu!

95
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,899
Get out!

96
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,560
Exploiting my gains,

97
00:07:57,560 --> 00:08:01,100
humiliating my body,
and ruining my reputation...

98
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,740
Human greed truly knows no bounds.

99
00:09:06,759 --> 00:09:09,519
- Quick, put it away.
- Yes.

100
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:11,019
All set. Let's go.

101
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,519
These two look nice, too.

102
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:20,639
Put them in my hair.

103
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:22,139
Yes.

104
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,399
Lady Jin, your makeup is done.

105
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,840
If anything is not right,

106
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,679
just let us know, Lady Jin.

107
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:30,799
No.

108
00:09:30,799 --> 00:09:32,299
I'm very pleased.

109
00:09:44,559 --> 00:09:47,080
I wondered what vase came to life.

110
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,399
Turns out it's a person.

111
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:51,559
Why not plant a whole garden on your head
to save the trouble?

112
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:54,360
Better to wear flowers on my head
than ice on your face.

113
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,960
Mind your own business.

114
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,600
Instead of preening yourself,

115
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,799
come serve my meal.

116
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:01,120
Serve your meal?

117
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,159
Why should I do that?

118
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:04,320
Are you handless?

119
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:06,879
Heavens, what a pity!

120
00:10:06,879 --> 00:10:08,639
Loaded with wealth,

121
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:11,220
even the handless are served.

122
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:14,320
Being dull and forgetful,

123
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:17,279
no amount of gold can make up for it.

124
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:19,320
[Contractor: Xie Yan]
Tell me,

125
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,879
[Debtor in Service: Jin Bao Zhu]
who's more pitiful?

126
00:10:20,879 --> 00:10:22,519
Fine, I'll sign.

127
00:10:22,519 --> 00:10:24,120
[Labor Debt Agreement]
What's there to be smug about?

128
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:27,980
666 taels a year. Who knows
who's really getting the raw deal?

129
00:10:29,419 --> 00:10:30,879
Jian Wei.

130
00:10:30,879 --> 00:10:32,379
Serve the dishes.

131
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,740
This one.

132
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:34,879
How do you know
you're not the one losing out more?

133
00:11:34,879 --> 00:11:36,519
A loss may bring good fortune.

134
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:39,779
Then allow me to wish you boundless fortune.

135
00:12:01,182 --> 00:12:03,533
We need to serve tea later.

136
00:12:03,533 --> 00:12:05,521
What's taking so long?

137
00:12:05,521 --> 00:12:08,899
How come there isn't a speck of meat
in your food?

138
00:12:10,181 --> 00:12:12,320
All style and no substance.

139
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,759
Looks so grand,

140
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:17,299
but it's just vegetarian chicken, pickles,
and plain tofu.

141
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,240
What is your problem?

142
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,600
I served with care,

143
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,539
and you're leaving already?

144
00:12:36,919 --> 00:12:39,440
Go explain the rules to her.

145
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,940
Yes, Master Yan.

146
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,840
Forgive me, Lady Jin.

147
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:47,759
Amid the morning rush,
I forgot to tell you the rules here.

148
00:12:47,759 --> 00:12:51,338
Master Yan was injured
riding a horse long ago.

149
00:12:51,338 --> 00:12:53,759
But he has a good heart. No need to fear him.

150
00:12:53,759 --> 00:12:56,607
Just be mindful
of what you say in front of him.

151
00:12:56,607 --> 00:12:58,639
Anything...

152
00:12:58,639 --> 00:12:59,799
related to it.

153
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:02,240
- For instance...
- Wait.

154
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,799
Running, jumping, kicking, leaping?

155
00:13:03,799 --> 00:13:04,799
- Don't say it!
- When we were eating just now,

156
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:06,076
I didn't say any of that.

157
00:13:06,076 --> 00:13:07,639
Why did he lose his temper?

158
00:13:07,639 --> 00:13:08,840
You might not know,

159
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,860
[Facade Allowance]
monthly stipends are divided

160
00:13:09,860 --> 00:13:11,440
[Issued by the household based on rank]
into facade and substance allowances.

161
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,800
[Strictly for attire, jewelry, and carriages
to uphold the family's prestige]

162
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:13,974
[Substance Allowance: A 50% cut
from the month's grain transport profits]

163
00:13:13,974 --> 00:13:15,043
[Reserved for private use
like food, linens, and undergarments]

164
00:13:15,043 --> 00:13:17,736
For private use on undergarments.

165
00:13:17,736 --> 00:13:19,039
I understand now.

166
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:22,480
Master Yan is crippled
and can't earn this substance allowance,

167
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:24,240
so naturally, the table is bare.

168
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,919
When I brought it up, he got hopping mad.

169
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:28,894
He's useless, yet faults my loose tongue.

170
00:13:28,894 --> 00:13:30,559
If you ask me, just give up the opium.

171
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:31,840
What opium?

172
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,799
Master Yan never touches that poison.

173
00:13:33,799 --> 00:13:35,559
He's still in pain,

174
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:37,360
and hates the bitter medicine.

175
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,759
Lady Qin went to great lengths

176
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:40,440
to get this powder for the pain.

177
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:43,639
What? He's picky even about taking medicine?

178
00:13:43,639 --> 00:13:45,639
Darn his legs! He thinks he's the Emperor?

179
00:13:45,639 --> 00:13:48,360
My lady. My lady, I beg you!

180
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,679
Never say that again!

181
00:13:50,679 --> 00:13:52,639
- Please...
- What if I insist on saying "leg"?

182
00:13:52,639 --> 00:13:54,000
Then say "shank".

183
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,679
Shanks means the same thing.

184
00:13:56,679 --> 00:13:58,360
Darn his shank!

185
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:01,440
None of you are officials,
yet you put on such grand airs.

186
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,159
Our master used to be

187
00:14:03,159 --> 00:14:05,240
the Director of the Canal Shipping Bureau.

188
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,980
- It's just that later, he...
- Jian Wei.

189
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,879
Weren't you taking me to serve tea?

190
00:14:15,879 --> 00:14:17,820
At least tell me who's there.

191
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:32,080
At the head is my grandmother.

192
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,360
All major family decisions rest with her.

193
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:38,000
But she has a morning pulse check,
so she'll be a bit late.

194
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,240
[Zhou Wan Jun, Mistress of the Xie Family]
Sitting in the seat of honor is my mother.

195
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:42,080
[Wife of the Second Master]
She is frail in health and gentle by nature.

196
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:44,779
This concubine, Jin Bao Zhu, greets Madam.

197
00:14:45,519 --> 00:14:47,019
Good.

198
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:54,480
Greetings, Madam Shen.

199
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,200
[Shen Man Yun]
On the left is my eldest uncle's wife.

200
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,019
[Wife of the Eldest Master]
She's always been outspoken.

201
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,559
Greetings, Lady Lin.

202
00:15:00,559 --> 00:15:02,159
Sitting below her on the outside

203
00:15:02,159 --> 00:15:03,679
[Lin Chan Yue]
is my eldest uncle's concubine.

204
00:15:03,679 --> 00:15:05,620
[Concubine of the Eldest Master]
She is usually a woman of few words.

205
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:09,960
- Greetings, Lady Qin.
- On the right is Lady Qin.

206
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:12,720
She currently manages the household
and is eloquent.

207
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,159
[Qin Ke Han]
When you deal with her,

208
00:15:14,159 --> 00:15:15,159
[Concubine of the Second Master]
remember to keep your guard up.

209
00:15:15,159 --> 00:15:18,559
That day,
my eyes didn't deceive me after all.

210
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:20,559
Dressed up like this,

211
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:22,940
you truly are a natural beauty.

212
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:32,919
Debts demand repayment!

213
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:34,440
- So early in the morning,
- Debts

214
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,259
- who is making such a racket?
- demand repayment!

215
00:15:37,039 --> 00:15:38,399
Nothing.

216
00:15:38,399 --> 00:15:40,559
Someone came causing trouble this morning,

217
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:43,360
claiming Yan owes a huge debt.

218
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,919
I thought he's well-behaved.

219
00:15:44,919 --> 00:15:47,320
How could he do something so reckless?

220
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:49,519
Some outsider's making it up to scam money.

221
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:51,200
I had him driven out,

222
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:54,840
but he's still loitering outside,
refusing to leave.

223
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:57,720
You owe money, so you should... Let go of me!

224
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,919
- Shut up!
- Let me go!

225
00:15:58,919 --> 00:16:00,419
Let him go.

226
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:06,000
Greetings, Madam.

227
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,559
All the ladies in charge,
I'm a clerk from Shuyu Pavilion.

228
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:11,700
I came to collect a debt today.

229
00:16:12,559 --> 00:16:14,639
The ledger is right here.

230
00:16:14,639 --> 00:16:16,679
A prominent family like yours

231
00:16:16,679 --> 00:16:19,519
surely wouldn't be more shameless

232
00:16:19,519 --> 00:16:21,639
than street thugs, would you?

233
00:16:21,639 --> 00:16:23,080
Watch your mouth!

234
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,580
Ming Pei.

235
00:16:39,303 --> 00:16:44,279
Lady Jin, Lady Qin
has always been full of praise for you,

236
00:16:44,279 --> 00:16:47,679
saying you're sharp-witted
and great with numbers.

237
00:16:47,679 --> 00:16:51,120
Since you're right here today
and this concerns Yan,

238
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:54,580
would you be so kind
as to look it over carefully?

239
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,460
Mama.

240
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,319
The plum blossoms are so beautiful.

241
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:24,660
I got you a few branches. Look!

242
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:30,619
Good morning, Madam.

243
00:17:32,079 --> 00:17:33,759
[Xie Qiao, Fifth Young Master of Xie Family]
Are you feeling better today?

244
00:17:33,759 --> 00:17:35,660
[Son of Qin Ke Han]
Same as usual.

245
00:17:36,559 --> 00:17:39,440
These blossoms
are truly delightful to look at.

246
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:43,839
Once I'm feeling well enough,
I'll go out and have a look too.

247
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:47,559
[Xie Xi, Third Daughter of the Xie Family]
Madam, the plum blossoms here are lovely,

248
00:17:47,559 --> 00:17:48,960
[Daughter of Qin Ke Han]
just like you.

249
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:52,160
Seemingly delicate,
yet more resilient to the cold than others,

250
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:54,059
not fearing the chill.

251
00:17:56,359 --> 00:17:58,799
You always know just what to say.

252
00:17:58,799 --> 00:18:03,000
All right then,
I'll pick some well-shaped branches

253
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:05,160
and put them in that celadon vase.

254
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:07,799
It'll liven up the room.

255
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:09,299
Here.

256
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,700
Come.

257
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,420
Let me see.

258
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:26,339
Lady Jin, how does it look?

259
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:29,900
Is what the clerk from Shuyu Pavilion
said true?

260
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:33,839
Lady Qin,

261
00:18:33,839 --> 00:18:37,519
I just came here and don't know much yet.

262
00:18:37,519 --> 00:18:39,019
Master Yan,

263
00:18:39,799 --> 00:18:42,019
do you owe Shuyu Pavilion money?

264
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:45,779
I've taken goods on credit, more than once.

265
00:18:45,779 --> 00:18:48,720
Then this won't be settled
in just a few minutes.

266
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:51,279
Sir, may I know how much he owes?

267
00:18:51,279 --> 00:18:53,319
From mid-year until now,

268
00:18:53,319 --> 00:18:57,980
it comes to 1,879 taels and 6 mace.

269
00:19:04,319 --> 00:19:07,079
That means calculated over six months,

270
00:19:07,079 --> 00:19:11,500
he'd have to owe 313 taels, 2 mace,
and 7 fen each month.

271
00:19:14,599 --> 00:19:18,440
That... That's enough for an ordinary family
for 40 or 50 years!

272
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:20,759
This won't do! We can't keep this hidden!

273
00:19:20,759 --> 00:19:22,920
Die Huan, go inform the Matriarch.

274
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,420
Wait.

275
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:30,559
The matter hasn't been settled yet.

276
00:19:30,559 --> 00:19:33,240
Why are you in such a rush
to inform the Matriarch?

277
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:36,000
Besides, if it's true,

278
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,960
I can just use my dowry to cover the deficit.

279
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:41,039
Why bring it to the Matriarch?

280
00:19:41,039 --> 00:19:44,740
She's having her pulse checked right now.

281
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,559
You're right.

282
00:19:48,559 --> 00:19:50,859
My concern gets the better of me.

283
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:56,200
I had no choice.

284
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,680
I manage the household.

285
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:59,119
Cheng Zong is away running the boats.

286
00:19:59,119 --> 00:20:02,480
If anything goes wrong,
I can't take the blame,

287
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,599
nor can I keep it hidden.

288
00:20:04,599 --> 00:20:06,394
No need to hide it.

289
00:20:06,394 --> 00:20:07,980
Just beat me to death.

290
00:20:08,799 --> 00:20:11,680
Yan, do not speak so rashly.

291
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,920
Yan, don't think like that.

292
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:16,200
Father has always favored you the most.

293
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:18,619
If not for your legs...

294
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,240
Xi misspoke.

295
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:24,140
I apologize on her behalf.

296
00:20:29,839 --> 00:20:31,500
Done with the ledger?

297
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:38,640
Sir, was this debt
incurred entirely by him alone?

298
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:41,640
Exactly. Honesty is everything in business.

299
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:44,980
Not one coin short, not one coin extra.

300
00:20:48,011 --> 00:20:49,400
Let me ask you this.

301
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:51,640
How much can one spend at Shuyu Pavilion

302
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:53,720
in a single visit?

303
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:55,680
Accompanied by the top courtesan,

304
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,599
imperial tribute tea and wine,

305
00:20:57,599 --> 00:20:59,599
and full musical entertainment tips,

306
00:20:59,599 --> 00:21:03,920
with extra tips included, 10 taels at most.

307
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:06,799
Which means,
even going to Shuyu Pavilion every day

308
00:21:06,799 --> 00:21:08,799
and spending 10 taels each time,

309
00:21:08,799 --> 00:21:11,960
the cost for half a year
would only be 1,800 taels.

310
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:14,920
Where did 1,879 taels and 6 fen come from?

311
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:18,059
Besides, who could go every day?

312
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:21,500
No one's body could take that.

313
00:21:25,799 --> 00:21:30,440
The tab is under Master Yan's name,
so it counts as his debt alone.

314
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:33,160
Beyond that, I know nothing.

315
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:36,640
So there are other expenses
charged to him as well.

316
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,720
You just said honesty is everything,

317
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:40,000
so why leave that out?

318
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:43,900
Since you're hiding something,
I can't acknowledge this debt yet.

319
00:21:46,119 --> 00:21:48,880
Shuyu Pavilion's bookkeepers
are second to none.

320
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,119
Check if you like,

321
00:21:50,119 --> 00:21:53,039
but my shopkeeper is pressing hard.

322
00:21:53,039 --> 00:21:55,740
The money is due today.

323
00:21:56,359 --> 00:21:57,640
This is interesting.

324
00:21:57,640 --> 00:22:01,599
You didn't ask for over half a year,
yet you demand it today.

325
00:22:01,599 --> 00:22:03,559
I'm just an errand man.

326
00:22:03,559 --> 00:22:06,359
Then please ask your shopkeeper
for some leeway.

327
00:22:06,359 --> 00:22:08,799
Whatever Master Yan owes,

328
00:22:08,799 --> 00:22:12,539
we will repay in full within seven days.

329
00:22:15,243 --> 00:22:18,960
So she's the Xie family's pillar of strength.

330
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:21,460
She seems quite approachable.

331
00:22:22,457 --> 00:22:23,957
Mother.

332
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:27,380
Everyone, be seated.

333
00:22:30,359 --> 00:22:31,640
Of course.

334
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:33,720
My shopkeeper made it clear beforehand.

335
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:36,440
If the Matriarch says it will be repaid,

336
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:40,960
we'll wait seven months,
let alone seven days.

337
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:44,980
I heard most of it from the back.

338
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:48,500
Lady Jin.

339
00:22:53,759 --> 00:22:55,539
Showing off.

340
00:22:56,279 --> 00:22:58,079
You're good with words and numbers,

341
00:22:58,079 --> 00:23:01,859
so you're the perfect person for this.

342
00:23:03,559 --> 00:23:05,539
Would you be willing?

343
00:23:16,440 --> 00:23:17,839
[Ying Tao]
This is Ying Tao.

344
00:23:17,839 --> 00:23:19,186
[Maid of the Xie Family]
She grew up under Matron Fang

345
00:23:19,186 --> 00:23:20,839
and serves in the manor.

346
00:23:20,839 --> 00:23:24,799
Don't be fooled by her age.
She's an experienced hand.

347
00:23:24,799 --> 00:23:27,880
The Xie manor has many rules,
unlike the outside world.

348
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,599
Since you're newly arrived,

349
00:23:29,599 --> 00:23:33,259
feel free to ask her
anything you don't understand.

350
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,119
Thank you, Matriarch.

351
00:23:41,119 --> 00:23:44,019
I... I'll remember
as your granddaughter-in-law.

352
00:23:44,839 --> 00:23:47,039
If you wish to go out, Lady Jin,

353
00:23:47,039 --> 00:23:49,519
[Matron Fang]
remember to inform Ying Tao first.

354
00:23:49,519 --> 00:23:52,099
[Steward of the Xie Family]
You must never act on your own.

355
00:24:00,496 --> 00:24:03,440
[Zhendianxi Hall]

356
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,960
She's been here half a day,

357
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:07,279
and Grandmother's assigned a maid to her.

358
00:24:07,279 --> 00:24:08,519
Even I never had one!

359
00:24:08,519 --> 00:24:09,839
How is that fair?

360
00:24:09,839 --> 00:24:11,200
A mere concubine!

361
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:12,400
- A village girl!
- Enough.

362
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:14,599
Enough, Xi.

363
00:24:14,599 --> 00:24:16,519
Put down those flowers and shears.

364
00:24:16,519 --> 00:24:18,599
If you hurt your hand, it'll look bad.

365
00:24:18,599 --> 00:24:20,079
Come here. Come.

366
00:24:20,079 --> 00:24:21,200
Come to me.

367
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:23,079
Let me see. Come here.

368
00:24:23,079 --> 00:24:24,519
- Mama...
- Come, give me your hand.

369
00:24:24,519 --> 00:24:26,920
Grandmother is biased toward the main branch!

370
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:28,000
He's just a cripple!

371
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,400
Kindness will go to waste!

372
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:30,680
- I really don't understand!
- Yes, you're right.

373
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:31,880
I don't understand!

374
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,680
Why don't you shout even louder

375
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:36,519
and summon all the maids and ladies
from other branches,

376
00:24:36,519 --> 00:24:39,119
so they can see
how the young lady of our branch

377
00:24:39,119 --> 00:24:41,579
makes a complete fool of herself?

378
00:24:42,759 --> 00:24:45,327
I wanted to find a timid girl
from a modest family,

379
00:24:45,327 --> 00:24:47,160
yet you insisted on a village girl.

380
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:48,400
You saw it today.

381
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:51,180
That sharp tongue of hers never backs down.

382
00:24:51,799 --> 00:24:55,106
She's going to be impossible to deal with
in the future.

383
00:24:55,106 --> 00:24:57,819
So you're blaming me, Mama?

384
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:02,119
How could I, my dear?

385
00:25:02,119 --> 00:25:04,160
You are my backbone.

386
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:06,480
It's all thanks to your strategies

387
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:08,559
that I took over the household.

388
00:25:08,559 --> 00:25:12,200
That's why the three of us
have a good life today.

389
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,720
- All right.
- Took over?

390
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,359
All right.

391
00:25:15,359 --> 00:25:18,119
A gentleman
never takes what belongs to others.

392
00:25:18,119 --> 00:25:19,920
Not take.

393
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:22,000
Zhou Wan Jun just isn't meant to have it.

394
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:25,059
She's frail and sickly,
so she gives it up herself.

395
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:30,160
Internal strife invites external trouble.

396
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:33,160
Xie Yan is stagnant water right now,

397
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:35,680
which only makes Father
and Grandmother pity him.

398
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:39,500
Better to stir the waters
before we make our move.

399
00:25:41,839 --> 00:25:43,640
I see now.

400
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:46,720
You wanted me to find someone of low status,

401
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:50,200
knowing the main branch
would resent her and make things hard,

402
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:51,680
just like today.

403
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:55,119
She forced that ledger onto the village girl.

404
00:25:55,119 --> 00:25:57,299
Could the village girl be happy?

405
00:25:58,039 --> 00:26:01,079
It gives us the perfect opportunity
to win her over.

406
00:26:01,079 --> 00:26:03,599
I really don't know
what you're so pleased about.

407
00:26:03,599 --> 00:26:07,220
Don't you realize
you've already botched half the plan?

408
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,279
What is the Xie family?

409
00:26:09,279 --> 00:26:13,000
A mere clerk dared to barge
into the main hall demanding debts!

410
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:14,799
Isn't it ridiculous?

411
00:26:14,799 --> 00:26:17,000
- I...
- If not for your sloppy management,

412
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:19,160
it was deliberate.

413
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:21,200
You gave yourself away.

414
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:22,920
Good thing I intervened.

415
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:26,900
Or how would you answer
if Zhou Wan Jun demanded an explanation?

416
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:30,759
Grandmother reminded Lady Jin
of the rules today,

417
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:33,319
and you thought she was completely oblivious?

418
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:36,339
Let me tell you.
That was an indirect jab at you!

419
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:39,680
Then... Then what should we do?

420
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:41,400
Go see someone right now,

421
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:45,240
and see another after the seven days are up.

422
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:47,039
- Me?
- Qiao,

423
00:26:47,039 --> 00:26:48,599
what can I do, then?

424
00:26:48,599 --> 00:26:51,160
Just wait, Mama.

425
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:53,119
What's the rush?

426
00:26:53,119 --> 00:26:56,339
Someone else is far more anxious than we are.

427
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:10,539
Almost done packing?

428
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:16,799
Ming Pei came by to urge me,

429
00:27:16,799 --> 00:27:20,259
telling me to move
to Master Yan's courtyard today.

430
00:27:21,839 --> 00:27:24,400
I know very well you don't want to go,

431
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:26,640
but the Matriarch has already decided.

432
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:28,539
What else can we do?

433
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:33,319
I don't blame anyone.

434
00:27:33,319 --> 00:27:35,279
I just lack the fortune

435
00:27:35,279 --> 00:27:37,740
to serve the Matriarch.

436
00:27:38,519 --> 00:27:42,200
Once you're over there,
talk less and do more.

437
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:45,759
Remember, keep your eyes open,
and your ears peeled.

438
00:27:45,759 --> 00:27:47,259
Understood?

439
00:27:54,119 --> 00:27:55,619
Take this.

440
00:27:57,119 --> 00:27:58,619
You should go.

441
00:28:22,559 --> 00:28:23,920
What?

442
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:26,480
No energy to sort out accounts,

443
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:28,539
but plenty of it to rage at me?

444
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:31,400
I want you to apologize.

445
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:34,079
Since you know the debt isn't mine,

446
00:28:34,079 --> 00:28:35,759
what did I do wrong?

447
00:28:35,759 --> 00:28:37,200
Why should I apologize?

448
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:38,640
You knew it and kept quiet?

449
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:40,119
You just watched unhurriedly

450
00:28:40,119 --> 00:28:41,599
and left the fallout to me.

451
00:28:41,599 --> 00:28:43,640
Even a butchered pig knows to squeal.

452
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:45,759
You're worse than a pig!

453
00:28:45,759 --> 00:28:47,559
Attend to the duties of your post.

454
00:28:47,559 --> 00:28:49,599
Who told you to rush into marrying in?

455
00:28:49,599 --> 00:28:51,799
Did you really think pie falls from the sky?

456
00:28:51,799 --> 00:28:53,299
Keep dreaming.

457
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:56,740
Glamorous from afar,

458
00:28:57,519 --> 00:28:59,519
but the stench hits you up close.

459
00:28:59,519 --> 00:29:02,700
Only then do you know
how filthy noble mansions are.

460
00:29:04,519 --> 00:29:07,119
That's what I call
all style and no substance.

461
00:29:07,119 --> 00:29:09,920
Understood, little firecracker?

462
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:11,599
You can't handle your own trouble,

463
00:29:11,599 --> 00:29:12,920
yet scold me like Father.

464
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:13,920
Have you no shame?

465
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:16,480
All those books went to waste on you.
Apologize!

466
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:18,440
Books taught me to tell right from wrong,

467
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:21,480
not to indulge an unreasonable shrew.

468
00:29:21,480 --> 00:29:23,480
It's clearly your own foolishness.

469
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:25,400
I'm making you apologize to me today!

470
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,640
You're asking for it!

471
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:29,000
You...

472
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:30,700
I'll never apologize today.

473
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:34,599
Not only are you going to apologize today,

474
00:29:34,599 --> 00:29:37,220
you're going to bow your head and do it.

475
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:58,480
It's all right.

476
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:00,180
Save the fake concern.

477
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:04,680
I worried that knocking your head
would make you stupider.

478
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:07,440
People call a fool like you a great scholar.

479
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:09,039
What a waste of my life!

480
00:30:09,039 --> 00:30:10,319
You're virtuous.

481
00:30:10,319 --> 00:30:11,680
You alone are unstained.

482
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:13,880
Stop blabbering nonsense.
I don't understand a word.

483
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,380
Thanks for the compliment.

484
00:30:24,519 --> 00:30:25,559
I can't read.

485
00:30:25,559 --> 00:30:26,720
You read. I calculate.

486
00:30:26,720 --> 00:30:28,119
I'm bad with brushes.

487
00:30:28,119 --> 00:30:29,619
Any charcoal?

488
00:30:36,512 --> 00:30:40,852
[Moonlit Radiance]

489
00:30:42,519 --> 00:30:44,079
Ying Tao, it hurts.

490
00:30:44,079 --> 00:30:46,319
Dozing off in broad daylight?

491
00:30:46,319 --> 00:30:48,220
Is this how you serve?

492
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,200
Forgive me.

493
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:55,029
My legs almost gave out
fetching charcoal just now.

494
00:30:55,029 --> 00:30:58,119
I couldn't help taking a brief nap.

495
00:30:58,119 --> 00:31:00,759
Serving your masters is your duty.

496
00:31:00,759 --> 00:31:02,938
Stop playing the victim.

497
00:31:02,938 --> 00:31:04,438
Go wash your face.

498
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:17,220
Miss Xi.

499
00:31:18,279 --> 00:31:19,559
This tea is refreshing.

500
00:31:19,559 --> 00:31:22,720
I'm delivering it to Yan and that village...

501
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:24,500
Lady Jin.

502
00:31:28,640 --> 00:31:32,400
You've been promoted
to Lady Jin's first-rank maid.

503
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:34,240
That's great news.

504
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:37,920
My mother prepared this cup of tea
specially for you

505
00:31:37,920 --> 00:31:39,539
as a gift.

506
00:31:40,759 --> 00:31:43,000
Thank you for your and Lady Qin's kindness.

507
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,559
I appreciate the thought,

508
00:31:44,559 --> 00:31:47,140
but I dare not accept this tea.

509
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:52,799
I heard that when you prepared tea
for Grandmother with Matron Fang,

510
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:56,039
you often brewed her leftover tea dregs.

511
00:31:56,039 --> 00:31:59,200
Now you refuse a proper cup of tea.

512
00:31:59,200 --> 00:32:04,220
Do you think these tea leaves
are worse than her tea dregs?
